    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Reliable framed-message transport for networked switchboard topics.</para>
<para>The backend owns a joinable I/O thread and serializes concurrent writers so topic frames cannot interleave on the shared byte stream. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
